.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt GENASSYM.CF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm genassym.cf
.Nd assym.h definition file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
file is used by
.Xr genassym.sh 8
to make constant C expressions known to assembler source files.
.Pp
Lines starting with
.Ql #
are discarded by
.Xr genassym.sh 8 .
Lines starting with
.Ic include ,
.Ic ifdef ,
.Ic if ,
.Ic else
or
.Ic endif
are preceded with
.Ql #
and passed otherwise unmodified to the C compiler.
.Pp
Lines starting with
.Ic quote
get passed on with the
.Ic quote
command removed.
.Pp
The first word after a
.Ic define
command is taken as a CPP identifier and the rest of the line has to be
a constant C expression.
The output of
.Xr genassym.sh 8
will assign the numerical value of this expression to the CPP identifier.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic export Ar foo
is a shorthand for
.Dl Ic define Ar foo Ar foo
.Pp
.It Ic struct Ar foo
remembers
.Ar foo
for the
.Ic member
command and does a
.Dl Ic define Ar FOO Ns _SIZEOF Li sizeof Ns Pq Ar foo
with the structure name converted to upper case.
.It Ic member Ar foo
does a
.Dl Ic define Ar FOO Li offsetof Ns Pq Ar last_struct , Ar foo
.It Ic member Ar foo Ar bar
does a
.Dl Ic define Ar FOO Li offsetof Ns Pq Ar last_struct , Ar bar
with its first argument converted to upper case.
.Pp
In the case where
.Ic struct
was invoked with an extra argument, as in
.Dl struct Ar foo Ar PREFIX_
the first argument of
.Ic member
will be prefixed by the remembered
.Ar PREFIX_ ,
before being converted to upper case.
.It Ic union Ar foo
is similar to the
.Ic struct
command, but applies to a union instead of a struct.
.It Ic config Ar ctype Ar gcc_constraint Ar asm_print_modifier
can be used to customize the output of
.Xr genassym.sh 8 .
.Pp
When producing C output, values are cast to
.Ar ctype
(default:
.Ic long )
before they get handed to
.Fn printf .
The
.Ar gcc_constraint
(default:
.Ic n )
is the constraint used in the
.Ic __asm__
statements.
The
.Ar asm_print_modifier
(default: empty) can be used to force
.Xr gcc 1
to output operands in different ways than normal.
For example, the
.Ql a
modifier stops
.Xr gcc 1
from emitting immediate prefixes in front of constants for the i386 port.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -compact
.It Pa sys/platform/${MACHINE_PLATFORM}/${MACHINE_ARCH}/genassym.cf
.It Pa lib/libc/${MACHINE_ARCH}/sys/asmcontext.cf
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr genassym.sh 8
.Sh HISTORY
The first use of
.Nm
files occurred in
.Ox 2.2 .
Its use was generalized to all ports for
.Ox 3.0 .
The
.Ic union
command appeared in
.Ox 3.5 .
